    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520300/extras/33481790eb0ee96bf3e0680cb28403b9.avif?t=1748921690\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have you ever been in a toxic relationship with a partner, friends, or family without even realizing it? </strong>Maybe this adventure will open your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is Love</strong> is a 2D puzzle-platformer that delves into the dark emotions behind toxic bonds. You\u2019ll guide an endearing character through 100 heart-wrenching real-life quotes collected from people who lived these painful experiences, all while evading a sinister antagonist determined to keep you under control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520300/extras/4c6c2e1283c396724e96738a31d78ca1.avif?t=1748921690\" data-has-big width=800 height=154 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>This is Love</i>, each of the 50 levels is an emotional journey, accompanied by real-life quotes that reflect the psychological and emotional struggles of abusive relationships. You'll explore symbolic, minimalist, and visually striking environments as your antagonist confronts you with manipulative, unsettling messages\u2014constantly trying to reopen old wounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal isn't just to move forward, but to understand, heal, and rediscover your inner strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520300/extras/6616b948179be9df8decc89f9526dc98.avif?t=1748921690\" data-has-big width=800 height=154 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Narrative:</strong> 100 real quotes from people who experienced toxic relationships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Symbolic Environments:</strong> Minimalist levels designed to reflect deep emotional states.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Introspective Gameplay:</strong> Simple, symbolic puzzles that mirror your emotional progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotive Soundtrack:</strong> A dark, atmospheric score that adapts to the emotions of each chapter, enhancing your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is Love</i> is an intimate experience that invites reflection on self-discovery, healing, and the human capacity to rise again after the darkest moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520300/extras/33481790eb0ee96bf3e0680cb28403b9.avif?t=1748921690\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have you ever been in a toxic relationship with a partner, friends, or family without even realizing it? </strong>Maybe this adventure will open your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is Love</strong> is a 2D puzzle-platformer that delves into the dark emotions behind toxic bonds. You\u2019ll guide an endearing character through 100 heart-wrenching real-life quotes collected from people who lived these painful experiences, all while evading a sinister antagonist determined to keep you under control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520300/extras/4c6c2e1283c396724e96738a31d78ca1.avif?t=1748921690\" data-has-big width=800 height=154 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>This is Love</i>, each of the 50 levels is an emotional journey, accompanied by real-life quotes that reflect the psychological and emotional struggles of abusive relationships. You'll explore symbolic, minimalist, and visually striking environments as your antagonist confronts you with manipulative, unsettling messages\u2014constantly trying to reopen old wounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal isn't just to move forward, but to understand, heal, and rediscover your inner strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520300/extras/6616b948179be9df8decc89f9526dc98.avif?t=1748921690\" data-has-big width=800 height=154 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Narrative:</strong> 100 real quotes from people who experienced toxic relationships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Symbolic Environments:</strong> Minimalist levels designed to reflect deep emotional states.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Introspective Gameplay:</strong> Simple, symbolic puzzles that mirror your emotional progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotive Soundtrack:</strong> A dark, atmospheric score that adapts to the emotions of each chapter, enhancing your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is Love</i> is an intimate experience that invites reflection on self-discovery, healing, and the human capacity to rise again after the darkest moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
